<title>USA: Equity Inns to offer 7.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Equity Inns to offer 7.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate investment trust Equity Inns Inc said Thursday it had proposed a public offering of 7.5 million shares of common stock in order to help pay for an acquisition.</p>
<p>In March, Equity entered into agreements to buy a portfolio of 28 Hampton Inn hotels for about $182 million.</p>
<p>The trust, which has more than 23 million shares in circulation, saw its stock close at 13-1/4 on May 14.</p>
<p>Equity owns 56 hotels with an aggregate of 6,679 rooms in 29 states.</p>
</text>
